{"title":"Silver Solstice Staff","slug":"Silver_Solstice_Staff","pageid":4791,"revid":20747,"timestamp":"2025-12-14T02:35:34Z","lastEditor":"SaibaMomoi20250505","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Function","value":"Allows you to pick up multiple objects at once"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.97.5"}]},"sections":[{"id":"obtaining","text":"Obtaining"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"obtaining\">Obtaining</h2>\n<ol><li>Obtain the following materials:\n<ol><li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Yellow_Rock_Candy/\">Yellow Rock Candy</a> (Must be Forged)</li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Winter_Star/\">Winter Star</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Silver_Sleigh_Bell/\">Silver Sleigh Bell</a></li></ol></li>\n<li>Go to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Santa's_Workshop/\">Santa's Workshop</a>(Placed correctly, it will create a particle effect.)\n<ol><li>Place the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Winter_Star/\">Winter Star</a> on the altar<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Use Winter Star\">Use Winter Star</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Place the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Yellow_Rock_Candy/\">Yellow Rock Candy</a> on the altar<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Use Yellow Rock Candy\">Use Yellow Rock Candy</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Plave the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Silver_Sleigh_Bell/\">Silver Sleigh Bell</a> on the altar<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Use Silver Sleigh Bell\">Use Silver Sleigh Bell</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Go to the top floor of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Santa's_Workshop/\">Santa's Workshop</a>.</li></ol></li>\n<li>Take your Silver Solstice Staff<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Take Silver Solstive Staff\">Take Silver Solstive Staff</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Take Silver Solstive Staff\">Take Silver Solstive Staff</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ol>\n\n</div>"}
